Cell["\<\
It is useful to be able to automate the analysis of CRN trajectories.  For \
example, we can easily get the peaks of each oscillation cycle.  Or the times \
at which a concentration hits some target can be found by numerically \
minimizing the squared difference of the concentration from the target.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.724720630216086*^9, 3.724720680406797*^9}, {
  3.819422651902903*^9, 3.8194226760182867`*^9}, {3.819427332035761*^9, 
